0019-gpui-desktop-browser-bridge.patch (combined series, 2026-11-13). Formerly 0014-gpui-desktop-browser-bridge.patch (original kept in nsh-host-patches/superseded-2026-11-13/).
Applies with patch -p1 at the root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src after every earlier patch of the series 0010-0020, in order.

gpui: desktop browser bridge (CDP shim per bridge WKWebView tab for the T3 server)

Against the all-speech tree (e626a8d + 0001-0003 + 0005 + 0005a + 0006-0009). Apply with patch -p1 at the
root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src. Adds host.call("desktopBrowser.supported"). See third_party/nsh-host/README.md (patch 0014).

